{"id": "unknown-2026-07-01-007", "date": "2026-07-01", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 7, "week": 27, "weekday": "Wed"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "positive", "score": 1.0, "keywords": ["surpass"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.65, "reasons": ["情緒極端"]}, "title": "Scotland’s solar capacity reaches 0.9 GW", "content": "<p>Latest government figures add that Scotland’s storage capacity surpassed 1.5 GW by the end of March. There are currently 0.2 GW of solar and 3 GW of battery storage projects under construction in Scotland.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/07/01/scotlands-solar-capacity-reaches-0-9-gw/\">Scotland’s solar capacity reaches 0.9 GW</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com\">pv magazine Global</a>.</p>\n", "sources": [{"name": "pv_magazine", "url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/07/01/scotlands-solar-capacity-reaches-0-9-gw/", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-07-01-008", "date": "2026-07-01", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 7, "week": 27, "weekday": "Wed"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Tests begin on Spain’s largest green hydrogen facility", "content": "<p>The 25 MW facility, powered by renewable electricity via a PPA, will produce about 2,800 tonnes of green hydrogen annually, replacing grey hydrogen and becoming Spain’s largest by 2026.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/07/01/tests-begin-on-spains-largest-green-hydrogen-facility/\">Tests begin on Spain&#8217;s largest green hydrogen facility</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com\">pv magazine Global</a>.</p>\n", "sources": [{"name": "pv_magazine", "url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/07/01/tests-begin-on-spains-largest-green-hydrogen-facility/", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-07-01-009", "date": "2026-07-01", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 7, "week": 27, "weekday": "Wed"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "SolaX introduces AC-side V2H system at Intersolar Europe 2026", "content": "<p>The system features an architecture that separates AC charging from controlled DC discharging and allows the EV charger and inverter to be installed up to 50 meters apart.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/07/01/solax-introduces-ac-side-v2h-system-at-intersolar-europe-2026/\">SolaX introduces AC-side V2H system at Intersolar Europe 2026</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com\">pv magazine Global</a>.</p>\n", "sources": [{"name": "pv_magazine", "url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/07/01/solax-introduces-ac-side-v2h-system-at-intersolar-europe-2026/", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-07-01-010", "date": "2026-07-01", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 7, "week": 27, "weekday": "Wed"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["installation_demand", "industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "positive", "score": 1.0, "keywords": ["record"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.65, "reasons": ["情緒極端"]}, "title": "German researchers achieve world record 25.5% efficiency for perovskite-CIGS tandem solar cell", "content": "<p>The result was confirmed by the European Solar Test Installation (ESTI).</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/07/01/german-researchers-achieve-world-record-25-5-efficiency-for-perovskite-cigs-tandem-solar-cell/\">German researchers achieve world record 25.5% efficiency for perovskite-CIGS tandem solar cell</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com\">pv magazine Global</a>.</p>\n", "sources": [{"name": "pv_magazine", "url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/07/01/german-researchers-achieve-world-record-25-5-efficiency-for-perovskite-cigs-tandem-solar-cell/", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-07-01-011", "date": "2026-07-01", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 7, "week": 27, "weekday": "Wed"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "RWE, PPC complete 930 MW solar cluster in Greece", "content": "<p>Germany’s RWE and Greece’s PPC have finished building nine solar farms in northern Greece. The two partners are now working on two additional projects in the area with a combined capacity of 567 MW, due for commissioning next year.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/07/01/rwe-ppc-complete-930-mw-solar-cluster-in-greece/\">RWE, PPC complete 930 MW solar cluster in Greece</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com\">pv magazine Global</a>.</p>\n", "sources": [{"name": "pv_magazine", "url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/07/01/rwe-ppc-complete-930-mw-solar-cluster-in-greece/", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-07-01-012", "date": "2026-07-01", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 7, "week": 27, "weekday": "Wed"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Vertical agrivoltaics for oats", "content": "<p>Researchers in Sweden studied oat production under a vertical agrivoltaic system during the 2024 growing season, comparing it with ground-mounted and open-field conditions. Results showed that crop performance was generally higher under agrivoltaic systems, highlighting their potential for productive dual land use.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/07/01/vertical-agrivoltaics-for-oats/\">Vertical agrivoltaics for oats</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazi", "sources": [{"name": "pv_magazine", "url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/07/01/vertical-agrivoltaics-for-oats/", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "maxeon-2026-07-01-013", "date": "2026-07-01", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 7, "week": 27, "weekday": "Wed"}, "entities": {"companies": ["maxeon"], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Maxeon, Qcells settle patent dispute", "content": "<p>Maxeon Solar Technologies and Qcells have settled their global patent dispute, ending all litigation over TOPCon solar cell technology and related claims.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/07/01/maxeon-qcells-settle-patent-dispute/\">Maxeon, Qcells settle patent dispute</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com\">pv magazine Global</a>.</p>\n", "sources": [{"name": "pv_magazine", "url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/07/01/maxeon-qcells-settle-patent-dispute/", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-07-01-014", "date": "2026-07-01", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 7, "week": 27, "weekday": "Wed"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Biwatt launches modular sodium-ion residential storage system", "content": "<p>The new PowerNest R5 Series features a wire-free, stackable architecture utilizing NFPP sodium-ion chemistry. It is available as a standalone battery pack or as an all-in-one system with an integrated single-phase hybrid inverter.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/07/01/biwatt-launches-modular-sodium-ion-residential-storage-system/\">Biwatt launches modular sodium-ion residential storage system</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com\">pv magazine Glob", "sources": [{"name": "pv_magazine", "url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/07/01/biwatt-launches-modular-sodium-ion-residential-storage-system/", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-07-01-015", "date": "2026-07-01", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 7, "week": 27, "weekday": "Wed"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Daikin unveils residential heat pump combining air-to-air and hydronic heating", "content": "<p>The X Series heat pump integraes cooling, hydronic heating, and domestic hot water via one outdoor unit with inverter-based load sharing. It uses R-32 refrigerant, supports 180–230 L hot water storage, and connects to HEMS via Onecta for centralized, PV-optimized energy management.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/07/01/daikin-unveils-residential-heat-pump-combining-air-to-air-and-hydronic-heating/\">Daikin unveils residential heat pump combining air-to-air and hydroni", "sources": [{"name": "pv_magazine", "url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/07/01/daikin-unveils-residential-heat-pump-combining-air-to-air-and-hydronic-heating/", "type": "rss"}]}
